        <mxCell id="Ob-IyWhHZAP3f3gMmU_s-6" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-radius: 7.5px; background-color: oklab(0.804634 0.0000367761 0.0000160933 / 0.1); padding-inline: 6px; padding-block: 2px; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --tw-leading: 1; line-height: 1; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;_inlineMarkdown_x0d1c_75 inline-markdown text-size-chat-sm font-mono blend bg-token-text-code-block-background rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 leading-none extension:bg-token-foreground/10 electron:bg-token-list-hover-background/60&quot;&gt;UIpNetDriver::InitListen / InitConnect / InitBase&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;의 정확한 차이:&lt;br&gt;지금 문서 흐름은 맞지만,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-radius: 7.5px; background-color: oklab(0.804634 0.0000367761 0.0000160933 / 0.1); padding-inline: 6px; padding-block: 2px; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --tw-leading: 1; line-height: 1; font-size: 12px;&quot; class=&quot;_inlineMarkdown_x0d1c_75 inline-markdown text-size-chat-sm font-mono blend bg-token-text-code-block-background rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 leading-none extension:bg-token-foreground/10 electron:bg-token-list-hover-background/60&quot;&gt;InitListen&lt;/span&gt;이 내부에서 어떤 순서로&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-radius: 7.5px; background-color: oklab(0.804634 0.0000367761 0.0000160933 / 0.1); padding-inline: 6px; padding-block: 2px; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --tw-leading: 1; line-height: 1; font-size: 12px;&quot; class=&quot;_inlineMarkdown_x0d1c_75 inline-markdown text-size-chat-sm font-mono blend bg-token-text-code-block-background rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 leading-none extension:bg-token-foreground/10 electron:bg-token-list-hover-background/60&quot;&gt;InitBase(false)&lt;/span&gt;와 socket bind를 호출하는지 한 번 더 코드 기준으로 정리하면 좋습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
