        <mxCell id="Ob-IyWhHZAP3f3gMmU_s-7" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 16px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; --tw-leading: 1.5; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 13px; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;text-size-chat leading-[calc(var(--codex-chat-font-size)+8px)] extension:leading-normal mt-0 mb-4 list-disc pl-4&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 6px; padding: 0px; --tw-leading: 1.5; line-height: 1.5;&quot; class=&quot;text-size-chat leading-[calc(var(--codex-chat-font-size)+8px)] extension:leading-normal mb-1.5&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 8px; --tw-leading: 1.5; line-height: 1.5;&quot; class=&quot;text-size-chat leading-[calc(var(--codex-chat-font-size)+8px)] extension:leading-normal my-2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-radius: 7.5px; background-color: oklab(0.804634 0.0000367761 0.0000160933 / 0.1); padding-inline: 6px; padding-block: 2px; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --tw-leading: 1; line-height: 1; font-size: 12px;&quot; class=&quot;_inlineMarkdown_x0d1c_75 inline-markdown text-size-chat-sm font-mono blend bg-token-text-code-block-background rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 leading-none extension:bg-token-foreground/10 electron:bg-token-list-hover-background/60&quot;&gt;FNetDriverAddressResolution::InitBindSockets&lt;/span&gt;와&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-radius: 7.5px; background-color: oklab(0.804634 0.0000367761 0.0000160933 / 0.1); padding-inline: 6px; padding-block: 2px; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; --tw-leading: 1; line-height: 1; font-size: 12px;&quot; class=&quot;_inlineMarkdown_x0d1c_75 inline-markdown text-size-chat-sm font-mono blend bg-token-text-code-block-background rounded-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 leading-none extension:bg-token-foreground/10 electron:bg-token-list-hover-background/60&quot;&gt;InitConnect&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;서버 쪽은 bind 후보 주소를 만들고 socket을 bind하는 흐름, 클라 쪽은 접속 대상 주소 해석 흐름입니다. 둘 다 “주소 준비”지만 목적이 다릅니다.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
