        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-36" value="1.RPC 파라미터 목록을 확인&lt;br&gt;2. Data 안에 값이기본값과 다르면 전송한다.&lt;div&gt;3.실제 값을 Writer 에 쓴다.&lt;br&gt;4. 데이터를 직렬화 (&amp;nbsp;NetSerializeItem )&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;이 코드가&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;파라미터 실제 값을 메모리에서 꺼내 네트워크 Writer에 쓰는 지점&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5983" y="11380" width="328" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-37" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.009;entryY=0.577;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-35" target="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-36" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-40" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-38" target="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-39" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-38" value="WriteFieldHeaderAndPayload" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5579" y="11517" width="328" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-39" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;WriteFieldHeaderAndPayload는 &quot;어떤 RPC 함수인지&quot;와 &quot;그 함수의 파라미터 값&quot;을 묶어서 다음 단계에서 Bunch에 넣을 수 있는 Payload 블록으로 만든다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5951" y="11517" width="369" height="83" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-43" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-41" target="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-42" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-41" value="UChannel::SendBunch" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5579" y="11667" width="328" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-42" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Bunch가 보낼 수 있는 상태인지 검사&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Channel Open/Close/Reliable 플래그 설정&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. 너무 크면 Partial Bunch로 분할&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. 가능하면 이전 Bunch와 Merge&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Reliable Bunch면 ACK 추적 목록에 등록&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. SendRawBunch로 NetConnection에 넘김&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;UChannel::SendBunch는 Bunch를 바로 소켓으로 보내는 함수가 아니라, Channel 단위에서 Bunch를 병합/분할/신뢰성 처리한 뒤 UNetConnection으로 넘기는 함수다.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5951" y="11675" width="390" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-44" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;if (Merge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp; Connection-&amp;gt;LastOut.ChIndex == Bunch-&amp;gt;ChIndex&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp; Connection-&amp;gt;LastOut.bReliable == Bunch-&amp;gt;bReliable&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp; Connection-&amp;gt;AllowMerge&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp; Connection-&amp;gt;LastOut.GetNumBits() + Bunch-&amp;gt;GetNumBits() &amp;lt;= MAX_SINGLE_BUNCH_SIZE_BITS)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;{&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Connection-&amp;gt;LastOut.SerializeBits(Bunch-&amp;gt;GetData(), Bunch-&amp;gt;GetNumBits());&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;같은 Channel이고&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Reliable 상태도 같고&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;크기도 허용되면&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;이전 Bunch 뒤에 현재 Bunch 데이터를 붙인다&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6381" y="11600" width="490" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-45" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Bunch가 너무 크면 여러 개의 Partial Bunch로 쪼갠다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;작으면 그대로 OutgoingBunches에 넣는다.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;if (Bunch-&amp;gt;GetNumBits() &amp;gt; MAX_SINGLE_BUNCH_SIZE_BITS)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;{&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;while (bitsLeft &amp;gt; 0)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;{&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;FOutBunch* PartialBunch = new FOutBunch(this, false);&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;PartialBunch-&amp;gt;SerializeBits(data, bitsThisBunch);&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;OutgoingBunches.Add(PartialBunch);&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;else&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;{&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;OutgoingBunches.Add(Bunch);&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6381" y="11930" width="490" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-46" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;PrepBunch&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;→PrepBunch는 Reliable Bunch에 시퀀스 번호를 붙이고 ACK/재전송을 위해 OutRec에 복사본을 저장한 뒤, 실제로 보낼 FOutBunch 포인터를 반환하는 함수다.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;UNetConnection::SendRawBunch는 FOutBunch를 Packet에 들어갈 수 있는 형태로 Header를 붙여 SendBuffer에 기록하는 함수이고, 실제 네트워크 전송은 FlushNet 이후 LowLevelSend에서 이루어진다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;다만&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 1px 6px; -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone; box-decoration-break: clone; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 0.833766 0.833766 0.833766 / 0.0905882); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.92em; display: inline; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;inline-markdown _inlineMarkdown_n9ah0_344&quot;&gt;bAutoFlush&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;가 켜져 있&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(191, 191, 191); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;으&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;면 함수 끝에서 바로&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 1px 6px; -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone; box-decoration-break: clone; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 0.833766 0.833766 0.833766 / 0.0905882); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.92em; display: inline; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;inline-markdown _inlineMarkdown_n9ah0_344&quot;&gt;FlushNet()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;을 호출할 수 있어&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6382" y="12247" width="470" height="183" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="J-B9BGBhoyWyexuGGkcS-48" value="UIpConnection::SendToRemote" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
