        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;FPacketIterator 생성자 내부 함수&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;AdvanceCurrentPacket() 함수에서 패킷을 받아온다.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5514" y="3617" width="446" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-17" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;FPacketIterator 생성자 내부에서&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;AdvanceCurrentPacket 함수 호출&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5274" y="3726" width="430" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-19" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;AdvanceCurrentPacket() -&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;ReceiveSinglePacket()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;SocketReceiveThreadRunnable ( 사용하는 경우 )&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;ReceiveQueue 에서 패킷 정보를 가져오고&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;아니라면&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Driver-&amp;gt;GetSocket()-&amp;gt;RecvFrom() 함수를 통해 패킷 정보를 가져온다.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5275" y="3807" width="579" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-21" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;CurrentPacket 정보에 저장후 사용&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5275" y="3887" width="430" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-22" value="Connection-&amp;gt;ReceivedRawPacket" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5266" y="4337" width="446" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-25" value="UNetConnection::ReceivedRawPacket은 소켓에서 받은 raw byte 패킷을 PacketHandler로 전처리한 뒤, FBitReader로 바꿔서 ReceivedPacket이 해석할 수 있는 Unreal 패킷 형태로 넘기는 함수다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5758" y="4347" width="446" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-26" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 1px 6px; -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone; box-decoration-break: clone; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 0.833766 0.833766 0.833766 / 0.0905882); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.92em; display: inline; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;inline-markdown _inlineMarkdown_1ni73_357&quot;&gt;Handler&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;는 받은 UDP 바이트를 Unreal 패킷으로 바로 해석하기 전에 먼저 거치는 “패킷 전처리 계층”이야.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5758" y="4437" width="446" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-28" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5758" y="4529" width="405" height="256" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-29" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Last 비트를 찾는 과정 &lt;br&gt;1. Data 에서 마지막 Byte 값을 가져온다.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;2. -1 하는 이유는 unreal 에서 마지막 비트에 1을 추가 하기 때문 &lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ( 실제 데이터가 아님 )&lt;br&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Segoe WPC, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;0x80 1바이트에서 최상위 비트를 찾는 값으로 쓰임.&lt;br&gt;4. *2 로 비트를 왼쪽으로 시프트&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6224" y="4532" width="446" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
