        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-36" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 1px 6px; -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone; box-decoration-break: clone; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box color(srgb 0.833766 0.833766 0.833766 / 0.0905882); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.92em; display: inline;&quot; class=&quot;inline-markdown _inlineMarkdown_1ni73_357&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;FBitReader&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;로 변환된 Unreal 패킷을 읽어서, PacketId/ACK를 처리하고, 내부 Bunch들을 Channel로 분배하는 함수&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;야.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;RPC 자체를 직접 실행하는 함수는 아니고,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; --tw-font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;RPC 데이터가 들어 있는 Bunch를 ActorChannel까지 전달하기 위한 Packet 해체 단계&lt;/span&gt;라고 보면 돼.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5524" y="4925.5" width="450" height="101" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
