        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-87" value="Bunch 가 Queue에 들어가는 조건&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sticky bg-token-border-light&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼt&quot;&gt;// 다음 중 하나라도 true이면 이 Bunch를 큐에 넣어야 한다:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼt&quot;&gt;//  1. 아직 resolve해야 할 Pending GUID가 있는 경우&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼt&quot;&gt;//  2. 이미 큐에 쌓인 Bunch가 있는 경우&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼt&quot;&gt;//  3. 이 Actor가 이전에 사용하던 채널이 닫힌 후에도 아직 Bunch를 처리 중인 경우&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼt&quot;&gt;//  4. Driver가 이 GUID에 대해 큐잉을 요청하는 경우&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼt&quot;&gt;//  5. 수신 Bunch 처리를 시간 제한으로 나누어 수행 중이고, 이번 프레임의 처리 시간이 부족한 경우&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5991" y="7297" width="653" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-94" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-88" target="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-92" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-96" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-88" target="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-93" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-97" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-88" target="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-95" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-88" value="&lt;div&gt;if (FNetGuidCacheObject const* const GuidCacheObject = GuidCache-&amp;gt;GetCacheObject(NetGUID))&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;{&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; if (UObject* const Object = GuidCacheObject-&amp;gt;Object.Get())&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; {&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; QueuedObjectsToTrack.Emplace(NetGUID, Object);&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; }&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; else&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; {&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; PendingGuidResolves.Add(NetGUID);&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Connection-&amp;gt;StartTickingChannel(this);&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; QueuedBunchObjectReferences.Add(GuidCache-&amp;gt;TrackQueuedBunchObjectReference(NetGUID, nullptr));&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; }&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5504" y="7494" width="640" height="253" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-104" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" parent="1" source="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-92" target="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-103" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-92" value="GuidCacheObject-&amp;gt;Object.Get() 이 성공하면 이미 로드가 된 상태인거고&lt;br&gt;실패하면 로드전 상태인것으로 보인다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;PendingGuidResolves 처리 하는 부분에서 로드가 이루어지는게 아닐까 싶다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6196" y="7571" width="402" height="106" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-106" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-93" target="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-105" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-108" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-93" target="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-107" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-93" value="GuidCacheObject-&amp;gt;Object.Get()&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;성공&lt;div&gt;이 NetGUID는 현재 월드에서 실제 UObject로 resolve 완료됨&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;실패&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;NetGUID 자체는 등록되어 있지만,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;아직 실제 UObject는 로드/생성/resolve되지 않음&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6207" y="7727" width="387" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-99" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-95" target="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-98" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-95" value="&lt;div&gt;QueuedBunches.Add(new FInBunch(Bunch));&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Connection-&amp;gt;StartTickingChannel(this);&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5624" y="8049.5" width="402" height="69" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-98" value="&lt;div&gt;이 Bunch는 아직 처리하면 안 됨&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;복사해서 QueuedBunches에 저장&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;↓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;나중에 Channel Tick에서 다시 처리 시도&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6201" y="8027.5" width="387" height="113" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-100" value="&lt;div&gt;QueuedBunches&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= ActorChannel에서 지금 처리하면 안 되는 Bunch를 보관하는 큐&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;주된 이유&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= 필요한 NetGUID/Object가 아직 준비되지 않았거나,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; 이전 Bunch 처리 순서를 보장해야 하거나,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; 이번 프레임 처리 시간이 부족하기 때문&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;처리 재개&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= PendingGuidResolves가 비고,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; Driver가 더 이상 큐잉을 요구하지 않고,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; 시간 제한도 괜찮으면 ProcessQueuedBunches()에서 ProcessBunch() 호출&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6175" y="8157" width="469" height="219.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-101" value="&lt;div&gt;InRec&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= UChannel 레벨&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= Reliable ChSequence 순서 때문에 대기&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;QueuedBunches&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= UActorChannel 레벨&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= NetGUID/Object resolve 또는 Actor 처리 가능 상태 때문에 대기&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6694" y="8155.5" width="469" height="120.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-102" value="&lt;div&gt;NetGUID 내부 정보들&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;→ UObject weak pointer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;→ OuterGUID&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;→ PathName&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;→ NetworkChecksum&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;→ Pending/Broken 상태&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5318.5" y="7884" width="469" height="120.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-103" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;나중에 처리 하는곳&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Channel Tick -&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 11.96px; text-align: start; background-color: color(srgb 0.833766 0.833766 0.833766 / 0.0905882); color: rgb(191, 191, 191);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;UActorChannel&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 11.96px; text-align: start; background-color: color(srgb 0.833766 0.833766 0.833766 / 0.0905882);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;::ProcessQueuedBunches()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6674" y="7594" width="265" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-105" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;PendingGuidResolves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;이 ActorChannel의 QueuedBunch들을 처리하기 전에&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;반드시 resolve되어야 하는 NetGUID 목록&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6704" y="7742" width="320" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CNrmBwoxl9Gnr_lOSToc-107" value="&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;QueuedBunchObjectReferences 역할&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;큐에 쌓인 Bunch가 참조하는 객체를 안전하게 붙잡아두기 위한 참조 목록이야.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6714" y="7869" width="320" height="85" as="geometry" />
