        <mxCell id="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11.96px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Consolas, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;UActorChannel::ProcessBunchInternal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5004" y="8345" width="446" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-4" value="&lt;div&gt;UActorChannel::ProcessBunchInternal()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= ActorChannel Bunch를 실제로 해석하는 함수&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Actor가 없으면 NetGUID 기반으로 Actor 찾기/생성&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. ReplicationFlags 준비&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Bunch 안의 ContentBlock payload를 하나씩 읽음&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. 대상 객체 RepObj의 FObjectReplicator로 payload 전달&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Replicator 후처리 및 새 Actor PostNetInit 처리&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5549.25" y="8294.5" width="375.5" height="161" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-5" target="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-6" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-5" value="&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;PackageMap 역할&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; --tw-font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;네트워크에서 UObject/Actor 참조를 NetGUID 기반으로 쓰고 읽는 객체&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;야.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5862" y="8512" width="500" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-6" value="&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600; --tw-font-weight: 600; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;UPackageMapClient 역할&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;주석상 서버에서는&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; --tw-font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;각 클라이언트 Connection마다 PackageMap 인스턴스가 따로 있음&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. 그래서 “이 클라이언트가 어떤 NetGUID를 알고 있는지 / ACK 했는지”를 Connection별로 추적할 수 있어.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5861" y="8619.5" width="500" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-7" target="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-5" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-15" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-7" target="fw3aHcV3YnYw64P1rIhG-14" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
